      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَرْبُ مَأْيَمَةٌ</span></b>  (T, S, M, Msb, K) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلنِّسآءَ</span> (M, K)
